  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">START Community-Led Innovation Programme, Kajo Keji, Central Equatoria State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through START Hub South Sudan, we will do a Community-Led Innovation Programme (CLIP) with Titi Foundation as main implementer in Kajo Keji, Central Equatoria. Programme has been co-designed in meetings between CTP, Titi and START Network (Backdonor ELHRA). The project shall be implemented in 2 circles in Kajo-Keji County in Payams of Kangapo 1 and Kangapo 2 respectively. The phases of the project shall include exploration, discovery, growth, and development phase across the 2 Payams.</narrative>
  </description>
